{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A narrative ASMR adventure in a supernatural barbershop.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cThe Midnight Barber\u201d blends rhythm mechanics and introspective storytelling.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clara's mysterious barbershop doesn't open until midnight. She serves a clientele of vampires, sirens, werewolves and all the other creatures who have nowhere else to go for their grooming needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as the country undergoes a shift from authoritarian dictatorship to democracy, Clara stumbles upon a secret that threatens to unravel a disturbing conspiracy. A secret that puts her in the crosshairs of the most influential individuals in Barcelona - supernatural or otherwise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trim to the Beat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match your barber tools to your clients' inner rhythm in a soothing, relaxing experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3131220/extras/118b04a93fc7fa9c8a414871fa44d994.poster.avif?t=1755857226\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3131220/extras/118b04a93fc7fa9c8a414871fa44d994.webm?t=1755857226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3131220/extras/118b04a93fc7fa9c8a414871fa44d994.mp4?t=1755857226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hand-drawn Atmosphere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose yourself in a rich, atmospheric journey through a supernatural Barcelona, where hand-drawn visuals, ambient rain, and moody lighting pull you deep into the rhythm of every story </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3131220/extras/3be2844d78fe1a494874a696853fb56d.poster.avif?t=1755857226\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3131220/extras/3be2844d78fe1a494874a696853fb56d.webm?t=1755857226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3131220/extras/3be2844d78fe1a494874a696853fb56d.mp4?t=1755857226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stories that cut deep</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge connections with a diverse cast of enchanted, discover their backstories, and influence their paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3131220/extras/5e492e757fb8f50dfb50867405ccfb0e.poster.avif?t=1755857226\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3131220/extras/5e492e757fb8f50dfb50867405ccfb0e.webm?t=1755857226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3131220/extras/5e492e757fb8f50dfb50867405ccfb0e.mp4?t=1755857226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Drive the Conversation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0</strong>Choose icebreakers and unlock new conversation topics and key information to solve your lines of inquiry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3131220/extras/903d5e2c07a5fe25a49f2658f509e38b.poster.avif?t=1755857226\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3131220/extras/903d5e2c07a5fe25a49f2658f509e38b.webm?t=1755857226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3131220/extras/903d5e2c07a5fe25a49f2658f509e38b.mp4?t=1755857226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A city in transition:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>Immerse yourself in late 70s Barcelona, a time of social change and political turmoil brimming with supernatural intrigue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3131220/extras/a3bd033485a82abdf5d609dd33bdcc51.poster.avif?t=1755857226\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3131220/extras/a3bd033485a82abdf5d609dd33bdcc51.webm?t=1755857226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3131220/extras/a3bd033485a82abdf5d609dd33bdcc51.mp4?t=1755857226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3131220?t=1755857226","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3131220/e7e7c4dbcfc5012d27b0ca33df9688dd956871d6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755857226","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3131220/3a840914c6e69cc24af4153c9d29b6ab0c18adb4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755857226","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3131220/3a840914c6e69cc24af4153c9d29b6ab0c18adb4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755857226","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":